# Product photo enrichment (core requirement)

Whenever the user adds a product **from a phone photo** (label, pack, shelf), the flow must:

1. **Take / pick a photo** of the product.
2. **Analyze & read the label** (vision/OCR — not heuristics-only stubs in production). Extract at least:
   - Product **name** (brand + Finnish title when visible)
   - **Size / pack weight** (e.g. 380 g)
   - **Barcode / EAN** when visible on pack
   - Any printed **price** if on shelf tags (optional; prefer distributor price)
3. **Search live distributors** for product info (not offline-only seed in production), prioritizing:
   - First: [https://www.k-ruoka.fi](https://www.k-ruoka.fi) (search by name and/or EAN)
   - Then other Finnish suppliers / food wholesale sources
4. From the live match, pull **name, size, retail price, EAN, image, product URL**.
5. **Match against current inventory/catalog**.
6. If **not already in inventory**, **suggest inserting** it.
7. **Prefill Add Product** with optimized fields from extract + web match (name, unit/YKSIKKÖ, pack size, EAN, price at **0% ALV**, image/`sourceUrl`, aliases) — not name+unit only.

## Reference example (phone pack → K-Ruoka)

Pack photo of **Atria Kaakao-vadelma rahkaohukainen 380 g** should resolve via live K-Ruoka to:

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| Brand / name | Atria · Kaakao-vadelma rahkaohukainen |
| Size | 380 g (unit `KPL` or weight-aware display; pack size 380 g) |
| EAN | `6407800019265` |
| Retail price (K-Ruoka) | ~2.69 € (incl. food ALV) → store inventory at **0% ALV** |
| sourceUrl | `https://www.k-ruoka.fi/haku?q=atria%20kaakao&tuote=atria-rahkaohukainen-kaakao-vadelma-380g-6407800019265` |

Do not treat a pack photo match as “done” if only local/stub data is used when a live K-Ruoka listing exists for that EAN/name.

## Implementation notes

- Scaffolding: `ProductScanScreen`, `RecordInventoryScreen`, `ConfirmScreen`, `FridgeReviewScreen`, `AddProductScreen`.
- Vision may still be stubbed in `src/lib/visionStub.ts`; Gemini path in `src/lib/geminiVision.ts`.
- **Full lookups** via `src/lib/kruokaLookup.ts` + `api/kruoka-lookup.js`:
  1. Proxy / same-origin `/api/kruoka-lookup` (or `EXPO_PUBLIC_KRUOKA_LOOKUP_URL`)
  2. Direct `kr-api/v2/product-search` (when Cloudflare allows)
  3. Offline seed (`seedKruoka.ts`)
  4. Open Food Facts + Keskofiles image + K-Ruoka search URL
- Wire through `matchExtractListingAsync` / `enrichFromExtractAsync` / `enrichProductFromPhotos` in `productEnrichment.ts`.
- Prefer enriching existing `VisionExtract` / `AddProduct` prefill rather than a parallel flow.
- Keep inventory prices at **0% ALV**; convert retail (14% food ALV) when importing from K-Ruoka. POS unit codes from `src/data/units.ts`.
- Do not drop this flow when refining logos, demos, or unrelated UI.
